# Beads local issue database — tracked in git when Dolt sync is unavailable
# (no `dolt` CLI on this machine, no remote configured). The local JSONL
# export from `br sync --flush-only` is the canonical accessible record.
# The lock files below are per-process runtime state, never part of that record.
.beads/*.db-lock-*
.beads/*.db-wal-lock-*

# Fork-local operating notes, loaded by Claude Code alongside CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.local.md
.ensemble/runtime-log.jsonl
.ensemble/*/active.lock

# Untracked, resumable PR-review-cycle state reports (TRD-007/TRD-008):
# committing one would change the PR head SHA and invalidate the very
# review it records.
.ensemble/pr-review/
